00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:09.476 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Notre-Dame-de-Grâce,

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:10.677 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Gracia Kasoki Katahwa,

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:11.912 size:53% position:73% line:53%
infirmière de 35 ans,

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:13.113 size:53% position:73% line:53%
apprivoise peu à peu

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:16.716 size:53% position:73% line:53%
