00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:17.918 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 venez du Congo,

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:19.119 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vous, on m'a dit?

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:20.353 size:53% position:73% line:53%
