00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:13.066 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la communauté noire.

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:14.301 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Bravo! On est honorés de...

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:15.535 size:53% position:73% line:53%
n.

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:16.736 size:53% position:73% line:53%
KARIM OUERTANI,

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:17.971 size:53% position:73% line:53%
propriétaire, Caravane Café

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:19.205 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On a besoin de changement.

00:02:17.037 --> 00:02:20.407 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et je pense que je le perçois

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:21.641 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vement et on va essayer

00:02:19.506 --> 00:02:25.478 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de travailler avec la nouvelle

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:26.646 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mairesse pour pouvoir donner

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:27.881 size:53% position:73% line:53%
