00:02:25.779 --> 00:02:29.115 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Sa priorité pour

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:30.317 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'arrondissement : acheter

00:02:28.181 --> 00:02:31.551 size:53% position:73% line:53%
