00:03:04.918 --> 00:03:08.989 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais elle promet de

00:03:06.119 --> 00:03:10.190 size:53% position:73% line:53%
demeurer l'infirmière

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:11.424 size:53% position:73% line:53%
