00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:17.530 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que tu m'as proposée,

00:03:15.228 --> 00:03:18.765 size:53% position:73% line:53%
bien, je le fais avec

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:19.999 size:53% position:73% line:53%
bienveillance quand même.

00:03:17.831 --> 00:03:21.201 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Sur la scène municipale,

00:03:19.065 --> 00:03:22.435 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Gracia Katahwa se fait

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:23.669 size:53% position:73% line:53%
