00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:24.871 size:53% position:73% line:53%
MAGDA POPEANU, conseillère

00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:26.106 size:53% position:73% line:53%
district CDN, Projet Montréal

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:27.307 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est ne femme de tête et de

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:28.541 size:53% position:73% line:53%
coeur, une femme organisée, mais

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:29.742 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en même temps, qui a le coeur

00:03:27.607 --> 00:03:30.977 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à la population, à l'écoute.

00:03:28.842 --> 00:03:32.212 size:53% position:73% line:53%
On a beaucoup discuter

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:34.013 size:53% position:73% line:53%
comment je peux mettre

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:35.215 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en pratique tout ce que

00:03:32.512 --> 00:03:36.449 size:53% position:73% line:53%
