00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:42.555 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avant de rentrer sur scène,

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.790 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tu utilises toute cette énergie-

00:03:41.654 --> 00:03:45.025 size:53% position:73% line:53%
là pour t'assurer de bien

00:03:42.856 --> 00:03:46.226 size:53% position:73% line:53%
