00:03:46.526 --> 00:03:49.896 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Au revoir!

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:51.097 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Merci, au revoir!

00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:52.332 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Prête à jouer le rôle

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:53.533 size:53% position:73% line:53%
